@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain

participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":FilterCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":ModelManager" as Model MODEL_COLOR

note over Logic, Command
  filter l/S4 s/MATH: execution after parsing.
  FilterCommand and its predicate already exist;
  the LogicManager activation is omitted.
end note
Logic -> Command : execute(model)
activate Command
Command -> Model : updateFilteredStudentList(predicate)
activate Model
note over Command, Model
  Set the predicate on the full roster's FilteredList.
  Reset StudentDisplayList to filtered source order.
  Observable changes refresh the panel
  (listener and cell callbacks omitted).
end note
Model --> Command
deactivate Model
Command -> Model : getStudentList()
activate Model
Model --> Command : displayed students
deactivate Model
Command --> Logic : result (showStudentList = true)
deactivate Command
note right of Logic
  Stored data is unchanged:
  no saveAddressBook call.
end note
[<-- Logic : result
note over Logic, Model
  MainWindow displays the feedback and calls
  StudentListPanel.showFromTop() after execution.
  Successful rendering is assumed.
end note
@enduml
